{
  "app_id": 5295330,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Water TD is a tower defense game where the enemy is a flood. Build turrets along the riverbanks and stop the water before it reaches your base. Hundreds of thousands of drops pour toward your base. Every turret has two builds that change how it fights. Water eats into the riverbanks as it flows. Channels get wider, islands shrink, and a turret on a crumbling bank goes down with it. Every level is a new map with its own flood to hold back. When the line starts to break, throw a fireball, raise a wall of ice, call down lightning, or send the whole flood back the way it came. Every level earns you points. Spend them on over 170 upgrades: unlock new turrets and abilities, make them stronger, and pick a build for each one."
  },
